MaildirStore amutable-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path "~/mail/amutable/"
Inbox "~/mail/amutable/inbox"
Trash "trash"

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
AuthMechs LOGIN
User "aleksa@amutable.com"
PassCmd +"keepassxc-helper '/Shared/Email/Amutable'"
TLSType IMAPS
TLSVersions +1.2 +1.3

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

Channel amutable-inbox
Far :gmail-remote:INBOX
Near :amutable-local:inbox
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
# The root IMAP directory is the Inbox, ignore all of the magic [Gmail] dirs.
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/"*
SyncState *

Channel amutable-sent
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Sent Mail"
Near :amutable-local:sent
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
Patterns *
SyncState *

Channel amutable-trash
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Trash"
Near :amutable-local:trash
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
Patterns * #* !"[Gmail]/"* #!"[Gmail]/All Mail" !"[Gmail]/Important" !"[Gmail]/Starred" !"[Gmail]/Bin"
SyncState *

#Patterns * !"[Gmail]/"* #!"[Gmail]/All Mail" !"[Gmail]/Important" !"[Gmail]/Starred" !"[Gmail]/Bin"

Group amutable
Channels amutable-inbox amutable-sent amutable-trash
